                                                "sense_id": "5c81acd3-cd24-3061-b653-e814223014f0",
                                                "text": "John, John, if you don't go you're no homo—no! You're only a fowl, an owl, a cow, a sow,—a doll, a poll; a poor, old, good-for-nothing-to-nobody, log, dog, hog, or frog, come out of a Concord bog."
